1. &Config: one signature for any owner
   describe(&config)              -> localhost x3
   describe(&boxed)               -> boxed x1
   describe(&counted)             -> counted x2
   config.host after the call     -> localhost

2. Option<Box<Node>>: the parent owns its children
   sum(&root)                     -> 6
   Option<Box<Node>>, words       -> 1
   drop(root)                     -> three destructors, parent first
   drop node 1
   drop node 2
   drop node 3

3. Rc<Cache>: whoever holds it last frees it
   holders                        -> 3
   builder dropped, home reads    -> 200
   home dropped, old reads        -> 301
   holders now                    -> 1
   drop(old)                      -> the last holder frees it
   drop cache

4. *const c_void into C, *mut c_void back
   find ':'                       -> Some((14, ':'))
   find '#'                       -> None   (memchr returned null)
